{"markdown":"**{{ notification.title | escape(strategy="json") }}**{% if notification.group == "GROUP_NEW_VULNERABILITY" %}\n**VulnID:** {{ subject.vulnerability.vulnId | escape(strategy="json") }}\n**Severity:** {{ subject.vulnerability.severity | escape(strategy="json") }}\n**Source:** {{ subject.vulnerability.source | escape(strategy="json") }}\n**Component:** {{ subject.component | summarize | escape(strategy="json") }}\n**Actions:**\n[View Vulnerability]({{ baseUrl }}/vulnerability/?source={{ subject.vulnerability.source | escape(strategy="json") }}&vulnId={{ subject.vulnerability.vulnId | escape(strategy="json") }}){% elseif notification.group == "GROUP_NEW_VULNERABLE_DEPENDENCY" %}\n**Project:** {{ subject.project | summarize | escape(strategy="json") }}\n**Component:** {{ subject.component | summarize | escape(strategy="json") }}\n**Actions:**\n[View Project]({{ baseUrl }}/projects/?uuid={{ subject.project.uuid | escape(strategy="json") }}){% endif %}{% if subject.component is defined %}\n[View Component]({{ baseUrl }}/component/?uuid={{ subject.component.uuid | escape(strategy="json") }}){% endif %}{% if notification.group == "GROUP_VULNERABILITY_ANALYSIS_COMMENT" %}\n**Comment Added by {% if subject.vulnerabilityAnalysisComment.commenter is not empty %}{{ subject.vulnerabilityAnalysisComment.commenter | escape(strategy="json") }}{% else %}System{% endif %} {% if subject.vulnerabilityAnalysisComment.commenterId is not empty %}({{ subject.vulnerabilityAnalysisComment.commenterId | escape(strategy="json") }}){% endif %}:** {{ subject.vulnerabilityAnalysisComment.content | escape(strategy="json") }}{% endif %}\n**Description:** {{ notification.content | escape(strategy="json") }}"}